  <type xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  <comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A person who works in the hospital. Each staff member is exactly one of Doctor, Nurse or MOA.</comment>
