  <type xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  <comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">One encounter of a patient with the hospital, for example an office visit, a phone call or a stay.</comment>
