  <type xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  <comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">One period of one visit at one location. The ER relationship TakesPlaceIn becomes this class, because the relationship has attributes.</comment>
