  <comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">The date of birth of the patient of the log record, as a value. The value is an xsd:date. OWL 2 has no xsd:date, so the range is rdfs:Literal, and SHACL checks the datatype. Columns: ChatSession.SubjectDateOfBirth, AuditEvent.SubjectDateOfBirth.</comment>
