  <type xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
  <comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">The result of the observation, as text. A value can be a number, a code or a text, so the range is xsd:string. Column: Observation.Value.</comment>
